# Google's pretrained hand-pose model: ~8MB third-party binary, fetched by
# download_hand_landmarker.py — not worth versioning, reproducible on demand.
ml/models/hand_landmarker.task
# Our own trained classifier (~600KB) and its derived reference landmarks
# / evaluation reports ARE versioned intentionally — small, and lets the
# repo run + be reviewed without forcing a retrain first.

